.TH JSONGATE 1
.SH NAME
jsongate \\- turn JSON findings into a gate decision
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B jsongate
jsongate --policy POLICY.yaml [--format json]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads findings from standard input and applies a YAML policy to emit a stable gate decision.
.SH OPTIONS
Use \fBjsongate --help\fR for the complete, version-specific flag list.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Uses the shared CLI status convention: 0 success, 1 a completed negative finding or policy failure, 2 invalid usage, 3 a partial result, and 4 a runtime failure. Not every status applies to every command.
